            "review_title": "Review at Cho Que Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Linhlinh2014\nHanoi, Vietnam25 contributions\n0\nfine atmosphere, let's try grilled beef in bamboo\nJan 2015 • Business\nWell, recently, my company held a year-end party in this restaurant. It's a little bit difficult to find this place but when you arrive, it won't make you disppointed with nicly and warmly decorated atmosphere like you are in countryside. \nI recommend you to try beef grilled in bamboo. It's delicious. Also, a quite simple dish is a fried sweet potato. \nThe dessert is decorated well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 3, 2015",
